# Pull request titles

Title and commit subjects use `Area: Summary` per `contribute/create-pull-request.md`.

- Area is UpperCamelCase (`Dashboard`, `Explore`, `Docs`, `Build`, `Plugins`).
- Summary starts with a capital letter and stays short.
- Bug fixes include `Fixes #<issue>` or `Closes #<issue>` in the description.
- Prefer one related issue per pull request.

Examples: `Explore: Add Live option for supported data sources`, `Docs: Change url to URL in all documentation files`.
